@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":DeleteProjectCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR

[-> Logic : execute(input)
activate Logic
ref over Logic, Command
    Parse removal arguments
    AddressBookParser / DeleteProjectCommandParser
end ref
ref over Logic, Model : Capture rollback state (shared diagram)
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
activate Model
Model --> Command : displayedContacts
deactivate Model
note over Command, Model
    ProjectContactSelection is omitted for simplicity.
    getValidatedContacts(model) delegates selection to
    ProjectContactSelection.selectContacts(model, indices).
    describeContacts formats conflicts and batch success contacts
    using the original displayed indices in selection order.
    ProjectContactSelection.updateContacts(...) invokes
    the command's createUpdatedContact(...) callback for each original,
    then calls Model.setPerson(...) for each replacement.
    Each callback uses original.withProjects(projects)
    to preserve contact details. The Person lifeline is omitted.
end note
Command -> Command : getValidatedContacts(model)
alt invalid index or any missing association
    Command --> Logic : CommandException
else all selections valid
    Command --> Command : validated selections
    Command -> Model : getAddressBook()
    activate Model
    Model --> Command : addressBook
    deactivate Model
    Command -> Command : build all replacements before mutation
    activate Command
    Command --> Command : replacements
    deactivate Command
    loop each captured original and replacement
        Command -> Model : setPerson(original, replacement)
        activate Model
        Model --> Command
        deactivate Model
    end
    Command --> Logic : result
end
deactivate Command

alt command failed
    [<-- Logic : error
else command succeeded
    ref over Logic, Model : Persist and record undo (shared diagram)
    [<-- Logic : result or save error
end
deactivate Logic
@enduml
